Getting started
===============

Assuming you're using mailwrapper(8) or mail/mailwrapper from pkgsrc :

- Edit the mailer.conf your system uses.  See @PREFIX@/share/examples/dma/mailer.conf
- You may also want to set up a crontab entry to retry messages from the queue in case of network drops etc

E.g.

*/5 * * * * @PREFIX@/libexec/dma -q


===========================================================================
N.B.

The dma executable has moved from @PREFIX@/sbin/dma to
@PREFIX@/libexec/dma.

When upgrading, update any existing mailwrapper configuration
(mailer.conf), scripts, crontabs or other references that use the old path.
Mail submission through the old path will fail until these are updated.
===========================================================================
